 - extensions handle transport behaviour
 - extension carry process target and targeting logic
 - injection of LinkedList tickets for process targeting
 - activation mask may be written by ticket
 - Queue count monitoring possible
 - automates handshakes for different use cases
    - activation mask based DistributorByTicket (1 to m) fly-by
    - queue scanning DistributorByQueue (1 to 1) fly-by
    - activation mask based ProcessByTicket (m to 1) stationary<y:LabelModel><y:SmartNodeLabelModel distance="4.0"/></y:LabelModel><y:ModelParameter><y:SmartNodeLabelModelParameter labelRatioX="0.0" labelRatioY="0.0" nodeRatioX="0.0" nodeRatioY="0.0" offsetX="0.0" offsetY="0.0" upX="0.0" upY="-1.0"/></y:ModelParameter></y:NodeLabel>
